---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Christian Prayer — Catechism Project">
  <header class="lesson-header">
    <h1 class="lesson-header__title">Christian Prayer</h1>
    <p style="color: var(--text-soft); font-size: 1.05rem; margin-top: 8px;">
      &laquo;Prayer is the raising of the mind and heart to God or the requesting of good things from God&raquo; (CCC 2559). Five topics to discover the life of prayer.
    </p>
  </header>

  <div style="margin-top: 32px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;">
    <a href="/catecismo-digital/en/prayer/33-christian-prayer/" style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding: 16px; background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius); text-decoration: none; color: var(--text); transition: all 0.2s;"
       onmouseover="this.style.borderColor='var(--accent)'" onmouseout="this.style.borderColor='var(--border)'">
      <span style="font-size: 1.2rem; min-width: 36px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent);">33</span>
      <div>
        <div style="font-weight: 600;">Christian Prayer</div>
        <div style="font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--text-muted);">CCC 2558-2658 &middot; The breath of the soul</div>
      </div>
    </a>
    <div style="display:flex;gap:6px;margin:0 0 16px 0;flex-wrap:wrap">
